# dotenv environment variable files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Terraform (tools/deploy/cloudflare/terraform). State can hold record contents
# and, at any later scope, secrets -- never commit it. The dependency lock file
# is deliberately NOT ignored: it pins provider versions and must be committed.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

